    "id": "cm-algo-3-3",
    "title": "Algorithm 3.3: First-Pattern Matching / Finding INDEX of P in T (PATTERN)",
    "book_reference": "Lipschutz & Seymour, Data Structures, Revised 4th Ed., Chapter 3: String Processing, Section 3.6, Page 71",
    "topic_tag": "String Processing",
