    "id": "cm-algo-4-4",
    "title": "Algorithm 4.4: Bubble Sort (BUBBLE)",
    "book_reference": "Lipschutz & Seymour, Data Structures, Revised 4th Ed., Chapter 4: Linear Arrays, Section 4.5, Page 102",
    "topic_tag": "Sorting",
    "content_type": "algorithm",
