    "id": "cm-algo-5-11",
    "title": "Algorithm 5.11: Traversing a Circular Header List (TRAVHL)",
    "book_reference": "Lipschutz & Seymour, Data Structures, Revised 4th Ed., Chapter 5: Linked Lists, Section 5.9, Page 163",
    "topic_tag": "Linked Lists",
