    "id": "cm-topic-6-6",
    "title": "Section 6.6: Quicksort — Divide-and-Conquer & Stack-Based Partitioning",
    "book_reference": "Lipschutz & Seymour, Data Structures, Revised 4th Ed., Chapter 6: Stacks, Queues, Recursion, Section 6.6, Page 240",
    "topic_tag": "Sorting",
    "content_type": "topic",
    "difficulty": "medium",
