    "id": "cm-problem-6-8",
    "title": "Example 6.8: Quicksort Partitioning / Reduction Step on 12-Element Array",
    "book_reference": "Lipschutz & Seymour, Data Structures, Revised 4th Ed., Chapter 6: Stacks, Queues, Recursion, Section 6.6 / Example 6.8, Page 240",
    "topic_tag": "Sorting",
